msgid "Central Scrutinizer"
msgstr "掌机远程管理"

msgid "Enabling this will temporarily change the launcher's screen timeout setting while Central Scrutinizer runs in background mode. The previous timeout is restored when background mode ends."
msgstr "启用此功能后，掌机远程管理在后台运行期间会临时更改启动器的屏幕超时设置。后台模式结束后将恢复原设置。"

msgid "Trusted clients are remembered. Pairing codes refresh after each use. Press Y to add another client."
msgstr "受信任的客户端会被记住。配对码每次使用后都会刷新。按 Y 添加其他客户端。"

msgid "Open the URL in a browser or press Y for QR pairing. Pairing codes are single-use and refresh automatically."
msgstr "请在浏览器中打开网址，或按 Y 使用二维码配对。配对码仅可使用一次并会自动刷新。"

msgid "Could not save setting."
msgstr "无法保存设置。"

msgid "Could not save the terminal setting."
msgstr "无法保存终端设置。"

msgid "Could not save the background keep-awake setting."
msgstr "无法保存后台保持唤醒设置。"

msgid "The QR code is too large to render on this screen."
msgstr "二维码过大，无法在此屏幕显示。"

msgid "Could not generate a pairing QR code."
msgstr "无法生成配对二维码。"

msgid "Run in Background requires at least one trusted browser."
msgstr "在后台运行至少需要一个受信任的浏览器。"

msgid "This screen refreshes automatically after a client pairs. Press Y to generate a new QR code for another trusted client."
msgstr "客户端配对后此屏幕会自动刷新。按 Y 为其他受信任客户端生成新二维码。"

msgid "Open the URL in a browser and enter the PIN once, or press Y for a QR code. PINs and QR links are single-use."
msgstr "请在浏览器中打开网址并输入一次 PIN，或按 Y 使用二维码。PIN 和二维码链接仅可使用一次。"

msgid "Trusted browsers stay connected in background mode.\n\nNew pairing is disabled until you reopen the app. Reopening it stops background mode and brings back pairing and settings. Active terminal sessions may need to reconnect."
msgstr "后台模式下受信任的浏览器仍保持连接。\n\n重新打开应用前无法进行新配对。重新打开应用会停止后台模式并恢复配对与设置，活动终端会话可能需要重新连接。"

